-label="Explore the activity Blue Line Exchange (BLEX)" class="card-photo" href="/en/businesses/blue-line-exchange/"><img alt="Foreign exchange" class="card-photo-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/exchange-market.webp"/><span class="card-photo-overlay"></span><span class="card-number">02 / 09</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="card-go">&nearrow;</span></a><div class="card-info"><span class="card-category">Foreign exchange</span><h3><a href="/en/businesses/blue-line-exchange/">Blue Line Exchange (BLEX)</a></h3><p>Financial operations shaped by clarity, control and informed decisions.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/businesses/blue-line-exchange/">Explore the activity <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></article></div></div></section><section class="contact-strip"><div class="shell contact-strip-inner"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="hairline"></span>05 / CONNECT / &Eacute;CHANGE</div><h2>The next conversation starts here.</h2><p>For partnerships, corporate enquiries and introductions, connect with the Blue Line team.</p><a class="btn btn-accent" href="/en/contact/"><span>Contact the Group</span><span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="huge-letter">B</span></section>
